// Package config tests (user memory) — T-16 characterization (Phase 1).
//
// THE LAW (roadmap Phase 1 + task list standing orders): the Python
// characterization tests are ported FIRST, then the code; the goldens were
// GENERATED by running the unmodified Python reference app
// (assadigit/GitCurator @ 98f4fc7) via testdiff/goldens/dump_config.py —
// never hand-typed. Regenerate with:
//
//	python3 testdiff/goldens/dump_config.py
//
// Ported suite: app/tests/test_userconfig.py — TestPathLaw (8),
// TestUnsetGrammar (6), TestCredentialKeyGrammar (5), TestLoadGlobalConfig
// (6), TestApplyTheFill (14), TestMirrorTheMemory (15, incl. the dry-run
// law), TestRoundTripTheOwnersScenario (2), TestVaultIdentityFamily (4).
// The GUI-door class (TestGuiUserConfig) is Phase 6's rehost; its PURE
// halves (the load path) are ported in config_test.go. The
// release-bookkeeping class tests the PYTHON repo's own files — not Go
// scope. The golden corpus additionally pins the fill/mirror matrices,
// the owner round trip, and the status lines byte-exact.
